  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-286",
  "title": "Timeline",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Timeline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s the same 1-month plan, compressed into crisp bullets."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Outcome:** Private gateway site with horizontal pagination, OTP access, private booking."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Cadence:** Weekly Mon planning + Thu review."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Milestones:** IA/copy lock → Auth MVP → Content-complete → Launch."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Kickoff:** Confirm audience, page list, tone, auth option, booking tool. Request drafts for Philosophy/Methodology/Who It’s For; headshot/mark; OTP sender domain."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Design/Tech:** Low-fi wires per horizontal “frame”; motion spec (pagination timing, reduced-motion); tech spec for OTP, sessions, whitelist, KV."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Review:** Approve IA, wires, motion, email templates."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Deliverables:** IA map, wires, motion spec, tech spec, OTP email templates."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Exit:** IA/motion approved; copy owners assigned."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Build shell:** Horizontal nav (keys/swipe/buttons/quick-nav), focus management, landmarks, SR labels."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Auth:** OTP request → verify → session cookie; whitelist gate; basic logs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Theme:** Monochrome tokens + type scale."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Review:** Staging with working shell + OTP; copy character limits aligned to frames."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Deliverables:** Staging URL, theme tokens, A11y pass-1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Exit:** OTP end-to-end works; shell stable on mobile/desktop."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Content:** Implement approved copy/images; keep public copy minimal."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Integrations:** Embed booking (behind auth); public inquiry → triage inbox."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Quality:** Perf (LCP <2.5s, CLS <0.1), A11y pass-2, mobile gestures QA, email deliverability (SPF/DKIM)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Review:** Content-complete walkthrough + fix list."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Deliverables:** Content-complete staging, booking live, QA report."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Exit:** No critical perf/a11y issues; copy frozen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Polish:** Micro-motion, error/empty states, visual refinement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Ops/Security:** Session TTL, whitelist rotation SOP, minimal audit snapshots."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Final QA:** Cross-device/browser, 404/500, backups, rollback plan, analytics (Plausible) + consent language."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Launch:** DNS cutover, smoke tests, 24–48h watch + hotfix window."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Deliverables:** Launch checklist, ops guide, 5-min video tour."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Exit:** Site live, stable, monitored."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Draft copy end of **Week 1**; final lock **mid-Week 3**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "OTP sender domain + DNS (SPF/DKIM) **Week 2**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Booking tool account **Week 3**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Public view: minimal purpose + access (no promo bloat)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Auth: OTP <15s delivery, >98% success, sensible session expiry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Navigation: smooth horizontal with reduced-motion honored and proper tab order."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Perf/A11y: LCP <2.5s, CLS <0.1, AA+ contrast, screen-reader navigable."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}